.IX Title "LEI-FORGET-SEARCH 1"
.TH LEI-FORGET-SEARCH 1 1993-10-02 public-inbox.git "public-inbox user manual"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lei\-forget\-search \- forget saved search
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
lei forget\-search [OPTIONS] OUTPUT
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Forget a saved search at \f(CW\*(C`OUTPUT\*(C'\fR,
where \f(CW\*(C`OUTPUT\*(C'\fR was supplied for argument of \f(CW\*(C`lei q \-o OUTPUT ...\*(C'\fR
A listing of outputs is available via \f(CW\*(C`lei ls\-search\*(C'\fR.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \-\-prune[=<local|remote>] 4
.IX Item "--prune[=<local|remote>]"
\&\f(CW\*(C`\-\-prune\*(C'\fR will forget saved searches if the \f(CW\*(C`OUTPUT\*(C'\fR no longer
exists.  \f(CW\*(C`\-\-prune=local\*(C'\fR only prunes local mailboxes,
\&\f(CW\*(C`\-\-prune=remote\*(C'\fR only prunes remote mailboxes (currently
\&\f(CW\*(C`imap://\*(C'\fR and \f(CW\*(C`imaps://\*(C'\fR).
.SH CONTACT
.IX Header "CONTACT"
Feedback welcome via plain\-text mail to <mailto:meta@public\-inbox.org>
.PP
The mail archives are hosted at <https://public\-inbox.org/meta>
